  "details": "Steps to reproduce:\n\n1. Upload a non-standard sized profile picture to your vrchat account (Anything other than 16x9)\n\n2. Go to https://furality.online/profile or any other application using VRChat's oath flow (Of which there are few)\n\n3. Log in using VRChat\n\n4. Notice the squished profile picture on the left side of the login panel\n\nSuggestion for fix:\n\n1. Add `object-fit: cover` to `.css-ung7df .size-slim .user-img-16x9`\n\nAttached files:\n\n1. Showcases the issue\n\n2. Showcases the potential fix for the issue",
